      "content": "idk, it just feels like they'd find peace if the shadow i cast was gone. everything is so heavy and loud because of my mistakes. wouldn't it be more honorable to just... let the legacy be pure again? to fix the stain by removing it? it feels like the only way to actually be selfless for once.",
